<title>USA: S&amp;P says Chambers to head strategic planning.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says Chambers to head strategic planning.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>McGraw-Hill Cos Inc affiliate Standard and Poor's Corporate Ratings said on Tuesday it has named William Chambers to the position of managing director for Strategic Planning and Marketing.</p>
<p>This is a newly created position and Chambers will be responsible for overseeing Corporate Ratings' global strategy, product development and marketing.  He will work closely with department executives and office heads within S&amp;P's worldwide network, the rating agency said.</p>
<p>Chambers previously supervised the ratings of all corporate debt issuers located outside the United States for S&amp;P.</p>
<p>- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678</p>
